    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "At any live sporting event, legions of fans come together for one specific reason, to cheer their favorite team to victory.  These moments can be both extremely excited, but often these events end in tragedy.  For my podcast episode, I will lead you on an exploration into the world of sports fandom, both the positives, the energy and the amazing moments, and the negatives, the rioting and violence that happens at these events.  The examples I use will be based from my experiences with Boston sports, as this is where I was raised.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
